          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The plugin has separate sbt 0.13, sbt 1 and sbt 2 artifacts. A project\u2019s locked sbt and Java selections govern its build; the packaged default is not a minimum version.",
          "sourceRevision": "87efce32058a19fab2bbe5e22ddfc6b18164ced9",
          "evidence": [
            "https://github.com/nix-purifiers/sbt-purifier/blob/87efce32058a19fab2bbe5e22ddfc6b18164ced9/pkgs/sbt/default.nix",
