          "text": "The recorded pinned Swift 6.3 SDK profile is packaged for x86_64-linux and aarch64-darwin. Its ARM64 Linux compiler is marked broken because of its linker.",
          "sourceRevision": "cd52ed8444afc1561ec1289a7ead04d6a2556ea0",
