          ],
          "description": "Default local commands use the existing Swift/SwiftPM toolset; SWIFT_EXEC can select its compiler. Capture and replay retain the observed runtime identity without adding a Swift SDK to the CLI closure.",
          "sourceRevision": "065ce2aaf13f32eccaf572d3918715125bd240bd",
