          ],
          "description": "For legacy-basic-v1, compilation must use the SDK home/compiler bound by the live adapter. It is a Nix value rather than a version string or serialized store path.",
          "sourceRevision": "4db074129b0dd2ac49fae0988804e1a327a48cfa",
          "evidence": [
            "https://github.com/nix-purifiers/ant-purifier/blob/4db074129b0dd2ac49fae0988804e1a327a48cfa/flake.nix",
